      "claim": "A reviewer states that Roblox's moderation system is automated and frequently makes mistakes, leading to false bans of innocent players.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Fun, but bad moderation Most games are fun, except slop games like steal a brainrot or ai made games, also the moderation isn’t even human, they are ai that make mistakes all the time and falsely ban people"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R376]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A user reports that the recent chat update removed voice chat functionality, preventing communication with friends.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Chat update sucks Bring back old chat Roblox is not the same and remove age verification I hate Roblox now"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R375]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A user says they were banned for saying the word \"bench\" and had their voice chat revoked, describing the moderation as unprofessional and arbitrary.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Taking things for no reason They Vcb and banned me for no reason,all I said was the word bench an they took my voice chat and banned my account.They be listening to hard and that’s not how it’s supposed to work"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R305]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A user reports that the age check feature is perceived as unnecessary and annoying, requesting its removal.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "It’s good but remove the age check I’ve been playing Roblox since 2022 and it’s great!but the new updates are kinda bad.If Roblox could remove the age check I think a lot of people would be happy."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R302]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A user reports that Spotify music cannot be used within Roblox games, and the microphone setting does not resolve the issue, limiting in-game music enjoyment.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "it’s good except one thing there is only one thing that i wish roblox allowed, and that is spotify music whenever i try to listen to spotify it won’t let me listen and i tried to turn off my microphone thingy but it still automatically turns off my music. so if you see this roblox i would really appreciate it if you add the feature to listen to music while playing"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R337]",
      "area": "money",
